WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
No messages does not mean no events
Illustrative AIO topic: a non-matching filter hides known retained records.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Confirm the connection and topic
Check the active profile and intended topic before changing credentials.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Inspect the active filters
The key filter asks for absent-order; the fixture record uses order-42.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Clear the filter and check read mode
First N reads retained records. Tail can wait for new events.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Retry the bounded read
Changing a filter alone does not establish what the broker contains.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Inspect a returned record
If the retry fails, retain its stage and correlation ID; never share credentials.
